OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be   
OL,6,Fcloudy for some with clear spells      
OL,7,Felsewhere tonight. Where skies clear,  
OL,8,Ftemperatures fall away sharply with an 
OL,9,Feasterly breeze and patchy frost       
OL,10,Fgiving a rather chilly feel.           
OL,12,CThursday:FAfter a frosty start for     
OL,13,Fsome, Thursday will be cloudy and dry, 
OL,14,Fwith patchy rain at times towards      
OL,15,FDevon and Cornwall. Turning wetter,    
OL,16,Fwindier and milder overnight.          
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
